  "scope": "An explicit at-most-two-cell parent selects the active symmetric ground sector with a gap to excluded sectors uniform in block size and volume. A vanishing occupation penalty controls the fixed-volume Gaussian six-wave limit. The graph and grouping are supplied; growing complete block connectivity, no uniform joint critical limit, no physical two-helicity reduction, and a parity mismatch with the tested linear Einstein identification remain. No TOE or new Lean theorem is claimed."
